        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flowers in the Attic (2014 film), Petals on the Wind (film)\n- People: Kiernan Shipka, Ellen Burstyn, Mason Dye, Heather Graham, Rose McIver, Wyatt Nash, Bailey Buntain\n- Television Series: Mad Men\n- Companies/Networks: Lifetime, AMC\n\nFacts:\n- Kiernan Brennan Shipka was born on November 10, 1999, and she is an American actress.\n- Kiernan Shipka is known for playing Sally Draper on the AMC series Mad Men.\n- Flowers in the Attic is a 2014 Lifetime movie starring Kiernan Shipka, Ellen Burstyn, Mason Dye, and Heather Graham.\n- Petals on the Wind is a 2014 Lifetime movie sequel to the 2014 adaptation Flowers in the Attic, and it stars Heather Graham, Rose McIver, Wyatt Nash, Bailey Buntain, and Ellen Burstyn.",
